      ],
      "body": {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Zyada tar prefixes 1000 ke steps mein order of magnitude (10 ki power ka andaza) batate hain. In se bohat bare aur bohat chhote numbers aasani se likhe jate hain aur non-significant (ghair zaroori) digits hat jate hain. SI se pehle jo prefixes pehle se use ho rahe the un mein se chaar SI mein bhi rakhe gaye (Table 1.3): centi (10⁻²), deci (10⁻¹), deka (10¹) aur hecto (10²)."
          },
          {
